SUMMARY: Kingsley Turns 33: A Beiber-Themed Birthday Show
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6:30pm | All Ages | Bar w/ ID | Tickets ADV $15 / DO
 S $25\n*Pricing Includes all ticketing fees*\n\nJoin indie pop artist Kin
 gsley for a one-night-only birthday celebration filled with music\, frien
 dship\, and a little Justin Bieber nostalgia.\n\nKingsley & Friends: The 
 Bieber Birthday Bash is a special concert celebrating Kingsley’s 33rd tri
 p around the sun. Throughout the evening\, a lineup of talented friends a
 nd collaborators will perform short sets while channeling their favorite 
 Justin Bieber eras — from Baby to Purpose and everything in between.\n\nG
 uests are encouraged to dress as their favorite version of Justin Bieber 
 (or your most fabulous pop star self) and come ready for a night of joy\,
  community\, and unforgettable performances.\n\nExpect a playful mix of o
 riginal music from Kingsley\, iconic Bieber moments\, and a room full of 
 people celebrating music\, friendship\, and another year of life in the K
 ingdom.\n\nWhether you're here for the nostalgia\, the costumes\, or the 
 pop spectacle — this birthday bash is going to be one for the books.
