SUMMARY: Tesla City Stories: Live Vintage Radio
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6:30pm | All Ages | Bar w/ ID | Tickets $10-60\n\nTe
 ll those April showers to dry up and those May flowers to hang on for a s
 ec: there’s a new show of The Tesla City Stories coming your way!\n\nFirs
 t up is an episode of The Wraith unperformed for audiences in over 80 yea
 rs: “After Hours Withdrawal.” After battling Hel\, the Norse goddess of t
 he Underworld\, and then a cosmic deity of Chaos called Malsumis\, you co
 uld imagine our half-dead avenger could use a break. How about a nice\, r
 elaxing bank heist?\n\nThen we’re off to the races in a new episode of Th
 e Off-Key Life of Viola Harper. Due to a goofy accident\, Viola finds her
 self having to sub-in for the jockey of her Arabian steed Jackie’s Girl! 
 Will she get busted before she makes it the the Winner’s Circle? The race
  is on in “It’s Viola By A Nose - But Not Furlong!”\n\nIt’s chills and la
 ughs\, plus the music of Smut City Jellyroll Society - when The Tesla Cit
 y Stories takes the stage at the Old Church Concert Hall this upcoming Ma
 y the 8th!
