 Surrounded by the soft glow of candlelight\, listen to your favorite melo
 dies from Shondaland's ‘Bridgerton’ series on Netflix\, reimagined by a t
 alented string ensemble. Ready to make amazing memories? Get your tickets
  today!\n\nGeneral Info\n📍 Venue: The Old Church Concert Hall\n📅 Dates 
