SUMMARY: FREE Lunchtime Concert: Tualatin Valley OMTA
DESCRIPTION:TOC presents Lunchtime FREE Concerts every FIRST and THIRD We
 dnesday of the month at Noon. Our gift to the community for over 56 years
 \, join us in person or on our Youtube Channel. https://www.youtube.com/c
 hannel/UCLiO4ZclyOFIe8HiOFzWJyg\n\nLocal Oregon Music Teachers Associatio
 n members perform a variety of classical piano music.\n\nThe Tualatin Val
 ley Oregon Music Teachers Association’s mission is to promote of the art 
 of music\, the advancement of musical education\, and the appreciation of
  music among the people of the community.\n\nThey are affiliated with the
  Music Teachers National Association (MTNA)\, the oldest professional org
 anization of independent and collegiate music teachers in the United Stat
 es.\n\nTheir district comprises of approximately 85 professional musician
 s\, and offers lessons with a private piano teacher or an instructor of v
 oice\, strings\, organ\, or guitar.\n\nFor more information\, check out t
 heir website: https://tvomta.org/ tvomta.org/ http://tvomta.org/\n\n\nWAT
 CH THE LIVESTREAM! https://youtube.com/live/himrs1QiLU0
